		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Fat, pox-covered giants who spread virulent leprosy. Dwell amongst rats and vermin.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12 (leather), <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 greatclub +6 (2d8 + leprosy) or 1 boulder (far) +6 (2d10), <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Leprosy</strong>. CON 12+ or 1d4 CON damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON.</p><p></p><p><strong>Vermin Whisperer</strong>. Speak with rats, bats, and other vermin. CHA 15+ or vermin must obey commands for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
